WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:33.416
<b>In the previous verse, Lord Krishna </b>
<b>revealed to Arjuna</b>

2
00:00:33.416 --> 00:00:37.333
<b>that they have had many births until now.</b>

3
00:00:37.333 --> 00:00:44.375
<b>The difference is that Arjuna does not</b>
<b>remember this, but Lord Krishna does.</b>

4
00:00:44.375 --> 00:00:45.083
<b>Now,</b>

5
00:00:45.083 --> 00:00:48.166
<b>in this verse and the coming few verses,</b>

6
00:00:48.166 --> 00:00:54.291
<b>Lord Krishna is explaining the nature </b>
<b>of His birth and actions in detail.</b>

7
00:00:58.916 --> 00:01:07.541
<b>This verse describes how Lord Krishna</b>
<b>takes birth and appears in this world.</b>

8
00:01:07.541 --> 00:01:09.375
<b>Krishna says,</b>

9
00:01:09.375 --> 00:01:12.000
<b>"I am unborn,</b>

10
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.916
<b>My body is imperishable,</b>

11
00:01:14.916 --> 00:01:18.041
<b>and I am the Lord of all beings.</b>

12
00:01:18.041 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>I manifest Myself in this world </b>
<b>through My divine power."</b>

13
00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:26.083
<b>It is important to understand</b>

14
00:01:26.083 --> 00:01:30.625
<b>that Lord Krishna's form or body is not material.</b>

15
00:01:30.625 --> 00:01:35.625
<b>We, as human beings, are souls distinct from </b>
<b>the covering of this body.</b>

16
00:01:35.625 --> 00:01:36.375
<b>However,</b>

17
00:01:36.375 --> 00:01:39.250
<b>there is no such distinction for Lord Krishna.</b>

18
00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:41.916
<b>His form and body are spiritual,</b>

19
00:01:41.916 --> 00:01:44.666
<b>which can never be destroyed.</b>

20
00:01:44.666 --> 00:01:49.083
<b>This is the meaning of the term (avyay aatma) </b>
<b>"imperishable soul" in this verse.</b>

21
00:01:49.083 --> 00:01:54.000
<b>And naturally, a form or </b>
<b>body that cannot be destroyed</b>

22
00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:58.375
<b>will not have a birth like ordinary human beings.</b>

23
00:01:58.375 --> 00:02:04.083
<b>This form is beyond birth, which is referred </b>
<b>to as "unborn" in the verse.</b>

24
00:02:04.083 --> 00:02:05.583
<b>Now, the question arises:</b>

25
00:02:05.583 --> 00:02:08.375
<b>Is His appearance in this mortal world</b>

26
00:02:08.375 --> 00:02:14.375
<b>and then departing from here different from </b>
<b>the birth and death of ordinary humans?</b>

27
00:02:14.375 --> 00:02:15.166
<b>Yes,</b>

28
00:02:15.166 --> 00:02:18.000
<b>it is entirely different.</b>

29
00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:24.291
<b>Souls like us take birth according to the </b>
<b>results of our sinful or virtuous actions.</b>

30
00:02:24.291 --> 00:02:30.291
<b>And this bondage of sinful and virtuous </b>
<b>actions determines where we will be born,</b>

31
00:02:30.291 --> 00:02:32.625
<b>in which living being's body we will be born,</b>

32
00:02:32.625 --> 00:02:38.250
<b>who our parents will be, or what special </b>
<b>qualities we will have at the time of birth.</b>

33
00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:40.625
<b>All of this is predetermined,</b>

34
00:02:40.625 --> 00:02:44.750
<b>and we are unable to choose it, we are helpless.</b>

35
00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:45.541
<b>However,</b>

36
00:02:45.541 --> 00:02:49.583
<b>Lord Krishna's birth is not due </b>
<b>to any bondage of actions.</b>

37
00:02:49.583 --> 00:02:52.333
<b>He does not take birth due to material nature;</b>

38
00:02:52.333 --> 00:02:58.125
<b>instead, He manifests Himself using </b>
<b>His spiritual power or divine nature.</b>

39
00:02:58.125 --> 00:03:05.041
<b>Krishna's appearance is exactly like the </b>
<b>rising of the sun every morning.</b>

40
00:03:05.041 --> 00:03:11.291
<b>When the sun rises, it does not mean that </b>
<b>the sun was born at that very moment.</b>

41
00:03:11.291 --> 00:03:16.250
<b>The sun only comes into our </b>
<b>sight at a predetermined time</b>

42
00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:21.083
<b>and then disappears from </b>
<b>our sight in the evening.</b>

43
00:03:21.083 --> 00:03:24.416
<b>So, does this mean the sun has died?</b>

44
00:03:24.416 --> 00:03:25.833
<b>No, right?</b>

45
00:03:25.833 --> 00:03:28.000
<b>The sun is always present,</b>

46
00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:30.625
<b>its light is always there,</b>

47
00:03:30.625 --> 00:03:32.208
<b>sometimes on the earth,</b>

48
00:03:32.208 --> 00:03:35.000
<b>and sometimes on another planet.</b>

49
00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.416
<b>Similarly,</b>

50
00:03:36.416 --> 00:03:41.458
<b>Krishna is eternal, always present, </b>
<b>and all-pervading,</b>

51
00:03:41.458 --> 00:03:48.666
<b>but only occasionally does He descend into </b>
<b>this mortal world and come into our sight.</b>

52
00:03:48.666 --> 00:03:51.250
<b>‘भूतानाम ईश्वरोऽपि’ - "Lord of all beings"</b>

53
00:03:51.250 --> 00:03:57.958
<b>in this verse these words mean that </b>
<b>Lord Krishna is the master of all living entities.</b>

54
00:03:57.958 --> 00:03:59.541
<b>Now, the question arises:</b>

55
00:03:59.541 --> 00:04:06.916
<b>If Krishna is the master of all living entities, what </b>
<b>compels Him to come to this mortal world?</b>

56
00:04:06.916 --> 00:04:11.041
<b>He is not bound by the compulsion </b>
<b>of karma like us humans,</b>

57
00:04:11.041 --> 00:04:14.916
<b>so what is the purpose behind coming here?</b>

58
00:04:14.916 --> 00:04:16.166
<b>Krishna says that</b>

59
00:04:16.166 --> 00:04:19.583
<b>His coming to this mortal world is not necessary,</b>

60
00:04:19.583 --> 00:04:27.250
<b>but still, due to His love and compassion </b>
<b>for all living entities, He comes here.</b>

61
00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:32.125
<b>This is the meaning of </b>
<b>the term "Atma-maya" in this verse.</b>

62
00:04:32.125 --> 00:04:34.333
<b>Now, another question arises:</b>

63
00:04:34.333 --> 00:04:37.041
<b>When does Krishna appear?</b>

64
00:04:37.041 --> 00:04:41.916
<b>Is there a regular time for His coming </b>
<b>to this mortal world?</b>

65
00:04:41.916 --> 00:04:47.083
<b>The answers to these questions </b>
<b>will come in the next verses.</b>

66
00:04:51.291 --> 00:04:55.166
<b>As I explained in this verse,</b>

67
00:04:55.166 --> 00:05:00.666
<b>the description of My own nature is that</b>

68
00:05:00.666 --> 00:05:04.333
<b>I am infinite,</b>

69
00:05:04.333 --> 00:05:06.416
<b>imperishable,</b>

70
00:05:06.416 --> 00:05:16.458
<b>and beyond all the material laws </b>
<b>that affect human birth.</b>

71
00:05:16.458 --> 00:05:18.583
<b>I know</b>

72
00:05:18.583 --> 00:05:20.458
<b>that after hearing all this,</b>

73
00:05:20.458 --> 00:05:24.916
<b>many questions must be arising in your mind.</b>

74
00:05:24.916 --> 00:05:26.833
<b>Have patience;</b>

75
00:05:26.833 --> 00:05:31.375
<b>everything will become </b>
<b>clear in the coming verses.</b>

76
00:05:31.375 --> 00:05:32.458
<b>But</b>

77
00:05:32.458 --> 00:05:37.875
<b>for this present moment, I extend </b>
<b>this invitation to you:</b>

78
00:05:37.875 --> 00:05:39.250
<b>come,</b>

79
00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:42.833
<b>understand the depth of your life today,</b>

80
00:05:42.833 --> 00:05:49.750
<b>consider many aspects that you may not</b>
<b>have thought of before.</b>

81
00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:51.083
<b>You</b>

82
00:05:51.083 --> 00:05:55.208
<b>are influenced by the cycle of birth and death,</b>

83
00:05:55.208 --> 00:05:58.708
<b>caught in the bondage of </b>
<b>sinful and virtuous actions,</b>

84
00:05:58.708 --> 00:06:03.166
<b>which is the result of your past actions.</b>

85
00:06:03.166 --> 00:06:04.083
<b>But</b>

86
00:06:04.083 --> 00:06:12.083
<b>it is also true that your real nature </b>
<b>is spiritual, just like Mine.</b>

87
00:06:12.083 --> 00:06:14.000
<b>Yes,</b>

88
00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:16.750
<b>you are different from Me,</b>

89
00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:17.958
<b>but</b>

90
00:06:17.958 --> 00:06:23.833
<b>in many ways, you are just like Me.</b>

91
00:06:23.833 --> 00:06:31.875
<b>This thought can inspire you to see your </b>
<b>existence and purpose from a new perspective.</b>

92
00:06:31.875 --> 00:06:35.875
<b>You often get entangled </b>
<b>in aspects of material life —</b>

93
00:06:35.875 --> 00:06:37.416
<b>momentary achievements,</b>

94
00:06:37.416 --> 00:06:39.333
<b>the beauty of the physical body,</b>

95
00:06:39.333 --> 00:06:44.166
<b>and give great importance </b>
<b>to your status in society.</b>

96
00:06:44.166 --> 00:06:45.291
<b>But</b>

97
00:06:45.291 --> 00:06:47.708
<b>think about it,</b>

98
00:06:47.708 --> 00:06:54.875
<b>behind these temporary, momentary things, </b>
<b>you have a spiritual existence</b>

99
00:06:54.875 --> 00:06:56.875
<b>that never dies</b>

100
00:06:56.875 --> 00:07:00.208
<b>and never perishes.</b>

101
00:07:00.208 --> 00:07:06.250
<b>If you understand that your true nature is the soul,</b>

102
00:07:06.250 --> 00:07:08.708
<b>which is beyond your physical form</b>

103
00:07:08.708 --> 00:07:15.541
<b>and the worldly roles you play in life, </b>

104
00:07:15.541 --> 00:07:20.208
<b>this thought will give you </b>
<b>an experience of liberation.</b>

105
00:07:20.208 --> 00:07:27.458
<b>It will inspire you to understand your real self,</b>

106
00:07:27.458 --> 00:07:30.500
<b>which is beyond material success.</b>

107
00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:35.041
<b>In this world, far more rewarding </b>
<b>than material success is</b>

108
00:07:35.041 --> 00:07:37.416
<b>selfless action, working</b>

109
00:07:37.416 --> 00:07:40.250
<b>for the welfare of society,</b>

110
00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:46.083
<b>and contributing to the upliftment of others.</b>

111
00:07:46.083 --> 00:07:48.125
<b>Just as I,</b>

112
00:07:48.125 --> 00:07:50.208
<b>due to the re-establishment of dharma</b>

113
00:07:50.208 --> 00:07:54.916
<b>and My affection for the living beings of this world,</b>

114
00:07:54.916 --> 00:07:57.958
<b>take birth in this world.</b>

115
00:07:57.958 --> 00:07:59.958
<b>think about it similarly,</b>

116
00:07:59.958 --> 00:08:07.416
<b>that you too can live your limited life </b>
<b>for the purpose of the well-being of others.</b>

117
00:08:07.416 --> 00:08:12.125
<b>Does this mean you give up everything? </b>

118
00:08:12.125 --> 00:08:13.750
<b>No.</b>

119
00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:15.208
<b>Absolutely not.</b>

120
00:08:15.208 --> 00:08:21.000
<b>It simply means that you know this truth,</b>

121
00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:27.083
<b>that there is immense joy in serving others,</b>

122
00:08:27.083 --> 00:08:34.375
<b>and this can be done along with your current </b>
<b>family and social responsibilities.</b>

123
00:08:34.375 --> 00:08:37.625
<b>Just a little change in thinking is needed.</b>

124
00:08:37.625 --> 00:08:39.750
<b>In whatever work you do,</b>

125
00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:45.000
<b>see how the welfare of others is happening;</b>

126
00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:51.000
<b>just bringing this perspective</b>
<b>will start giving you joy.</b>

127
00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:52.791
<b>If you are a farmer,</b>

128
00:08:52.791 --> 00:08:56.083
<b>you are nourishing people.</b>

129
00:08:56.083 --> 00:08:58.166
<b>If you are a vehicle driver,</b>

130
00:08:58.166 --> 00:09:01.875
<b>you connect people to each other,</b>

131
00:09:01.875 --> 00:09:05.250
<b>take them to their destinations.</b>

132
00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:08.541
<b>If you work in an organization,</b>

133
00:09:08.541 --> 00:09:10.500
<b>the services of that organization</b>

134
00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:16.166
<b>and their products make life simpler </b>
<b>for some customer or the other.</b>

135
00:09:16.166 --> 00:09:18.750
<b>You have a big contribution in this.</b>

136
00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:20.708
<b>Think about it,</b>

137
00:09:20.708 --> 00:09:23.250
<b>in whatever work you do,</b>

138
00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:26.791
<b>the welfare of others is inherent.</b>

139
00:09:26.791 --> 00:09:28.750
<b>Within your limited capacities,</b>

140
00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:31.583
<b>you can also do charity,</b>

141
00:09:31.583 --> 00:09:33.500
<b>do social service,</b>

142
00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:35.875
<b>support an orphan,</b>

143
00:09:35.875 --> 00:09:38.791
<b>educate them.</b>

144
00:09:38.791 --> 00:09:40.208
<b>There are many ways.</b>

145
00:09:40.208 --> 00:09:43.541
<b>It's just a matter of changing the perspective.</b>

146
00:09:43.541 --> 00:09:46.000
<b>It's a matter of believing</b>

147
00:09:46.000 --> 00:09:51.166
<b>that there is immense joy in </b>
<b>the well-being of others.</b>

148
00:09:51.166 --> 00:09:53.083
<b>I know this,</b>

149
00:09:53.083 --> 00:09:59.125
<b>that's why I am present here </b>
<b>for the welfare of mankind.</b>

150
00:09:59.125 --> 00:10:01.125
<b>Think a little deeper,</b>

151
00:10:01.125 --> 00:10:04.375
<b>make your thinking spiritual,</b>

152
00:10:04.375 --> 00:10:06.000
<b>not material.</b>

153
00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:15.000
<b>My coming to this mortal world is not necessary,</b>

154
00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.625
<b>but</b>

155
00:10:16.625 --> 00:10:23.916
<b>I have still taken many incarnations </b>
<b>here for ages and ages.</b>

156
00:10:23.916 --> 00:10:26.000
<b>The reason for</b>

157
00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:30.291
<b>this is My love for mankind,</b>

158
00:10:30.291 --> 00:10:32.041
<b>My compassion,</b>

159
00:10:32.041 --> 00:10:36.166
<b>and also the establishment of </b>
<b>a righteous environment,</b>

160
00:10:36.166 --> 00:10:40.750
<b>so that human life becomes easy.</b>

161
00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:45.958
<b>It is My responsibility to guide mankind properly,</b>

162
00:10:45.958 --> 00:10:47.458
<b>because</b>

163
00:10:47.458 --> 00:10:49.958
<b>I am capable of doing so,</b>

164
00:10:49.958 --> 00:10:51.416
<b>and</b>

165
00:10:51.416 --> 00:10:53.375
<b>also willing.</b>

166
00:10:53.375 --> 00:10:57.208
<b>On a smaller level, this responsibility </b>
<b>and this thinking</b>

167
00:10:57.208 --> 00:11:00.541
<b>should also be there for the elders of the family.</b>

168
00:11:00.541 --> 00:11:08.416
<b>It is their responsibility to create an atmosphere</b>
<b>in the family that is full of love.</b>

169
00:11:08.416 --> 00:11:12.583
<b>And the initiative for this has </b>
<b>to be taken by the elders.</b>

170
00:11:12.583 --> 00:11:13.583
<b>Because</b>

171
00:11:13.583 --> 00:11:16.458
<b>they have more experience.</b>

172
00:11:16.458 --> 00:11:21.958
<b>They have seen all those phases</b>
<b>- personal, social, emotional –</b>

173
00:11:21.958 --> 00:11:26.875
<b>that the youth of the family are</b>
<b>going through at this time.</b>

174
00:11:26.875 --> 00:11:28.291
<b>Also,</b>

175
00:11:28.291 --> 00:11:33.125
<b>here is a lesson for the youth of the family as well.</b>

176
00:11:33.125 --> 00:11:34.625
<b>Arjuna</b>

177
00:11:34.625 --> 00:11:38.458
<b>has sought guidance from Me,</b>

178
00:11:38.458 --> 00:11:40.541
<b>and remember,</b>

179
00:11:40.541 --> 00:11:44.125
<b>asking for help is not a weakness,</b>

180
00:11:44.125 --> 00:11:46.500
<b>it is a sign of courage.</b>

181
00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:53.333
<b>It shows that you have a strong </b>
<b>desire to resolve your dilemmas.</b>

182
00:11:53.333 --> 00:11:56.041
<b>Now imagine,</b>

183
00:11:56.041 --> 00:12:00.791
<b>the whole family sits together regularly,</b>

184
00:12:00.791 --> 00:12:03.958
<b>there is such a positive atmosphere,</b>

185
00:12:03.958 --> 00:12:09.375
<b>where all the members of the family </b>
<b>openly talk about their lives,</b>

186
00:12:09.375 --> 00:12:11.250
<b>give suggestions to each other.</b>

187
00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:15.166
<b>Where the elders can guide the youth,</b>

188
00:12:15.166 --> 00:12:21.500
<b>the youth of the family can give a </b>
<b>modern perspective to the elders.</b>

189
00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:22.750
<b>There</b>

190
00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:24.958
<b>is happiness for both in this.</b>

191
00:12:24.958 --> 00:12:26.833
<b>And also think,</b>

192
00:12:26.833 --> 00:12:30.000
<b>if the family sits together regularly,</b>

193
00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:34.541
<b>then every time there will not be a </b>
<b>discussion only on problems.</b>

194
00:12:34.541 --> 00:12:39.125
<b>There will be many joyful </b>
<b>things among each other.</b>

195
00:12:39.125 --> 00:12:42.833
<b>How beautiful this atmosphere will be.</b>

196
00:12:42.833 --> 00:12:44.625
<b>Think about it.</b>

197
00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:56.750
<b>I have taken many incarnations </b>
<b>on this earth for many eras,</b>

198
00:12:56.750 --> 00:13:02.625
<b>so that I can guide mankind.</b>

199
00:13:02.625 --> 00:13:04.250
<b>Also,</b>

200
00:13:04.250 --> 00:13:12.041
<b>I am not doing all this because </b>
<b>of My supremacy or prestige,</b>

201
00:13:12.041 --> 00:13:14.666
<b>it is also My responsibility,</b>

202
00:13:14.666 --> 00:13:16.250
<b>and also love.</b>

203
00:13:16.250 --> 00:13:17.708
<b>Remember, </b>

204
00:13:17.708 --> 00:13:21.500
<b>even if it is your work area,</b>

205
00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:29.041
<b>whenever there is a lack of guidance there, </b>
<b>problems will keep increasing.</b>

206
00:13:29.041 --> 00:13:34.166
<b>This is why every organization </b>
<b>needs efficient leadership.</b>

207
00:13:34.166 --> 00:13:38.416
<b>And the person suitable for </b>
<b>the position of leadership</b>

208
00:13:38.416 --> 00:13:42.791
<b>is the one who leads not by </b>
<b>authority, prestige or force,</b>

209
00:13:42.791 --> 00:13:43.666
<b>but</b>

210
00:13:43.666 --> 00:13:46.291
<b>by becoming an example himself,</b>

211
00:13:46.291 --> 00:13:51.958
<b>who leads, by considering it his responsibility.</b>

212
00:13:51.958 --> 00:13:55.791
<b>Even though I am the master of this universe,</b>

213
00:13:55.791 --> 00:13:57.000
<b>but</b>

214
00:13:57.000 --> 00:14:00.333
<b>at this time Arjuna needs Me,</b>

215
00:14:00.333 --> 00:14:06.458
<b>so I am becoming his charioteer, his helper.</b>

216
00:14:06.458 --> 00:14:13.875
<b>I am making him understand, not blaming </b>
<b>him for why he is afraid.</b>

217
00:14:13.875 --> 00:14:16.250
<b>What kind of leadership do you do?</b>

218
00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:17.416
<b>Remember,</b>

219
00:14:17.416 --> 00:14:21.375
<b>the duty of a person appointed </b>
<b>to a leadership position</b>

220
00:14:21.375 --> 00:14:26.041
<b>is not only to make decisions </b>
<b>and give orders to others,</b>

221
00:14:26.041 --> 00:14:31.958
<b>but his role should often be that of a facilitator</b>

222
00:14:31.958 --> 00:14:37.166
<b>who willingly not only lets young </b>
<b>colleagues move forward,</b>

223
00:14:37.166 --> 00:14:42.750
<b>but also lends them a hand, also guides them.</b>

224
00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:49.833
<b>And also teaches them when mistakes </b>
<b>are made, rather than start blaming.</b>

225
00:14:49.833 --> 00:14:54.541
<b>When I am the source of spiritual knowledge,</b>

226
00:14:54.541 --> 00:14:58.416
<b>I am the master of the entire world,</b>

227
00:14:58.416 --> 00:15:02.125
<b>then do I not have other powers</b>

228
00:15:02.125 --> 00:15:06.333
<b>through which I can make Arjuna win,</b>

229
00:15:06.333 --> 00:15:10.125
<b>solve other problems of this earth?</b>

230
00:15:10.125 --> 00:15:11.791
<b>Think about it.</b>

231
00:15:11.791 --> 00:15:12.958
<b>But</b>

232
00:15:12.958 --> 00:15:17.125
<b>doing so will not uplift them.</b>

233
00:15:17.125 --> 00:15:18.416
<b>Therefore,</b>

234
00:15:18.416 --> 00:15:24.541
<b>I have incarnated here with a spirit of service, </b>
<b>with a spirit of help.</b>

235
00:15:24.541 --> 00:15:25.958
<b>Remember,</b>

236
00:15:25.958 --> 00:15:28.291
<b>the true meaning of leadership</b>

237
00:15:28.291 --> 00:15:32.041
<b>is the upliftment of others, their progress.</b>

238
00:15:32.041 --> 00:15:34.958
<b>Leadership is successful</b>

239
00:15:34.958 --> 00:15:40.750
<b>only when you make others capable </b>
<b>of leadership as well.</b>

240
00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:43.041
<b>Think about this.</b>

